{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03429","headline":"赠苏少府赴任江南余时还京 · 崔湜","name":"赠苏少府赴任江南余时还京","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丈夫不叹别，达士自安卑。\n揽泣固无趣，衔杯空尔爲。\n流云春窈窕，去水暮逶迤。\n行舟忽东泛，归骑亦西驰。\n秦地多芳草，江潭有桂枝。\n谁言阻遐阔，所贵在相知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔湜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03429.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03429","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}